ing. By default, the OS might allow SMS messaging. Available for fully managed, dedicated, and corporate-owned work profile devices.","categoryId":"929c169a-3480-467c-9f47-d1836b359ef7","baseUri":"/com.android.deviceRestrictionPolicy/","offsetUri":"/smsBlocked/","rootDefinitionId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.smsblocked","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"androidEnterprise","technologies":"android"},"defaultOptionId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.smsblocked_false","options":[{"itemId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.smsblocked_false","displayName":"False","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.smsblocked_true","displayName":"True","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.mobilenetworksconfigblocked","name":"MobileNetworksConfigBlocked","displayName":"Block configuring mobile networks","description":"If 'True', the device is prevented from configuring mobile network settings. If 'False', Intune doesn't change or update this setting. By default, the OS might allow mobile network configuration. Available for fully managed, dedicated, and corporate-owned work profile devices.","categoryId":"929c169a-3480-467c-9f47-d1836b359ef7","baseUri":"/com.android.deviceRestrictionPolicy/","offsetUri":"/mobileNetworksConfigBlocked/","rootDefinitionId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.mobilenetworksconfigblocked","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"androidEnterprise","technologies":"android"},"defaultOptionId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.mobilenetworksconfigblocked_false","options":[{"itemId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.mobilenetworksconfigblocked_false","displayName":"False","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"com.android.devicerestrictionpolicy.mobilenetworksconfigblocked_true","displayName":"True","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationCh